      "content": "It sounds like you're going through a profound and painful dismantling, a real sense of loss where the bright things have faded into something bleak. That feeling of watching everything decay, without the satisfying conclusion, is incredibly heavy. Please know that this feeling of being stuck in the middle of the collapse is a valid, agonizing place to be. Sometimes, the quiet darkness is just the necessary space before the next thing, even if you can't see it yet.",
